==Battleground==
*1 [[Package Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critters]], [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Units]] and fast attackers can be used to make the stage go by quicker, but are otherwise unnecessary.

